==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|richten}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|*rihten}}, from {{inh|nl|gem-pro|*rihtijaną||to right}}, derived from {{m|gem-pro|*rehtaz||right, straight}} (modern {{m|nl|recht}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈrɪxtə(n)/|lang=nl}}
* {{audio|Nl-richten.ogg|audio|lang=nl}}

===Verb===
{{nl-verb|richtte|gericht}}

# {{lb|nl|transitive}} to [[direct]], [[aim]]

====Conjugation====
{{nl-conj-wk|richt}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|nl|richting}}
* {{l|nl|aanrichten}}
* {{l|nl|africhten}}
* {{l|nl|oprichten}}
* {{l|nl|uitrichten}}
* {{l|nl|verrichten}}

